   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Los dos pilares del italiano",
    "@en": "The two pillars of Italian"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Essere** y **avere** son auxiliares esenciales e irregulares. Conviene memorizar sus seis formas en presente de memoria.",
     "@en": "**Essere** and **avere** are essential and irregular auxiliaries. It is appropriate to memorize its six forms in this memory."
    },
    {
     "@es": "En **avere**, las formas **ho**, **hai**, **ha** y **hanno** llevan una **h** muda gráfica obligatoria: sirve para no confundirlas por escrito con **o** (o bien), **ai** (a los), **a** (a) y **anno** (año). En la pronunciación, la «h» no suena jamás.",
     "@en": "In **avere**, the **ho**, **hai**, **ha** and **hanno** forms carry a mandatory graphic **h** mute: it serves not to confuse them in writing with **o** (or), **ai** (a), **a** (a) and **anno** (year). In the pronunciation, the «h» never sounds."
    }
   ]
